==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage should be easy as none of the enemies in the stage are strong enough to pose any real threat. Spawn meatshields such as [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]], then spawn ranged attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]]. You should be able to defeat the Celeboodle and the Sir Seals fairly easily.

