==Trivia==
*Deep Ocean Blue's Japanese name, Yūzan Ocean (ユーザン海原), is a reference to the character Yūzan Kaibara (海原 雄山) from the cooking manga [[wikipedia:Oishinbo|''Oishinbo'']], playing off of his surname's meaning (ocean).

